1. Abstract

A unified simulation architecture is introduced that integrates planetary physics, chaotic state evolution, cryptographic provenance, and multi‑timeline validation. The Chronos‑State Matrix enables image‑derived initial conditions for hyper‑chaotic bifurcation, producing physically constrained alternate futures validated through SSIM thresholds. This framework represents a new class of planetary modeling.

